## What changed (tests and spec only; Green owns the code)

- **R1 (text overlap, PM pass limit).** Every counted photo now measures the union of the bounding
  boxes of visible text boxes that paint over the photo. A text box is an element with non-empty own
  text. The rule skips the photo's own ancestors and a figcaption that sits below the photo. The
  share is exact (coordinate compression over the clipped boxes). Limit: 10 percent of the photo
  area. The 30 percent grid rule stays. The photo report prints `textOverlap=N%` and up to three
  text boxes.
- **F1.** The aspect and short-side rule now covers every loaded photo whose src holds
  `/images/products/`, plus every photo in a `program-card-*` or `product-block-*` block, plus the
  report-results file `/images/blended-learning.png` (explicit list with the reason). The Tutor
  picture and the report-results picture are inside the rule now.
- **F2.** An `<img>` in a page `main` element with an empty src or no `currentSrc` adds a problem and
  fails the case; it is no longer skipped. The badge rule needs both signals: the file name starts
  with `qr`, `logo`, or `icon`, and the alt names a logo, an icon, or a QR code. Both rules are in
  `spec.md` AC-1.
- **F3.** The plan task 1.1 line now says the pre-fix e2e run was skipped and the hero unit test is
  the pre-fix proof.
- **Home Mastery card.** `/` at 390 px asserts that the card centre falls within 10 percent of the
  viewport centre, or its width is at least 90 percent of the photo width. The locator is the
  page's `figure` element; the home page renders one figure, the Mastery card.
- `spec.md` AC-1 gains the text rule, the broken-image rule, the two-signal badge rule, and the home
  Mastery card rule.

